					<summary
						class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink"
						>Can I post to Instagram or TikTok from my phone without downloading?<svg
							xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
							width="24"
							height="24"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
