							><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg
						></summary
					>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
						Yes. Open the carousel on your phone, tap Publish, then Share to Instagram (or TikTok,
						RedNote, Threads, LinkedIn), one platform at a time. Your phone&#x27;s share sheet hands
						every page to the app in order, and the caption is copied so you just paste it. No ZIP,
						no AirDrop. Works on iPhone and Android; on a computer, Publish downloads the pages
						instead.
					</p>
