					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">
						Anyone with the link, no account needed. A view link shows the pages. An edit link can
						also change the text, layout and style. A publish link can also post it from a phone,
						counted on your plan. They never see your Brand settings, image library or other
						carousels, and a link you turn off stops working at once. Share links are on Creator and
						Studio.
